{"id":"5647","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5647_main_a-very-thin-low-and-dissolving-sheet-of-altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图中大范围浅灰色云片是云素形式的高积云（成层云种）。云素的大小仅小于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一臂距离处的3指宽</span>（这种度量适用于在地平线以上超过30°角看到的那些云素）；这确认是高积云，但也表明该云层位于中云高度范围的下端。这些云素均极薄，可显露出太阳的位置（透光云类），并间隔有明显的小间距晴空（漏隙云类）。</p>\n<p>云片已开始消散；该过程正显露出地平线方向的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云块</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stefan Kämpfe","location":"德国，爱尔福特，安德烈亚斯沃尔施塔特","latitude":"纬度: 51° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 11° 0' 0'' E","date":"29 October 2011 0800 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.7"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5647_syn_a-very-thin-low-and-dissolving-sheet-of-altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>南边的高压脊维持着该地区稳定的天气</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5172_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这层中云是高积云。其<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">圆形云团和卷轴</span>视宽为1°-5°，有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阴影</span>。该高积云的具体云种可列为层状云，因为云的天空覆盖范围大。云片很透光，可显露出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">太阳的位置</span>，因此它也是透光云类。在某些地方，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云素之间有空隙</span>，这也表明是漏隙云类，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">长且大致平行的卷轴</span>表明也适用波状云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 36'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 49' 26'' W","date":"31 August 2014 0850 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.7"}]}]}